<title>CYPRUS: SOCCER-CYPRUS DRAW WITH RUSSIA 1-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CYPRUS DRAW WITH RUSSIA 1-1.</headline>
<dateline>PARALIMNI, Cyprus 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus and Russia</p>
<p>drew 1-1 (halftime 1-1) in their World Cup group five qualifier</p>
<p>on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cyprus - Sinica Gogic 31</p>
<p>Russia - Igor Simutenkov 32</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>Russia		 4   2   2   0  10   2   8</p>
<p>Israel		 4   2   1   1   4   4   7</p>
<p>Bulgaria	     3   2   0   1   6   4   6</p>
<p>Cyprus		 4   1   1   2   4   8   4</p>
<p>Luxembourg	   3   0   0   3   1   7   0</p>
<p>Remaining matches:</p>
<p>1997:</p>
<p>March 30 - Luxembourg v Israel</p>
<p>April 2  - Bulgaria v Cyprus</p>
<p>April 30 - Israel v Cyprus</p>
<p>April 30 - Russia v Luxembourg</p>
<p> June 8   - Bulgaria v Luxembourg</p>
<p> June 8   - Russia v Israel</p>
<p> Aug 20   - Bulgaria v Israel</p>
<p> Sept 7   - Luxembourg v Cyprus</p>
<p>Sept 10  - Bulgaria v Russia</p>
<p> Oct 11   - Cyprus v Luxembourg</p>
<p> Oct 11   - Russia v Bulgaria</p>
</text>
